{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>They ate the manna.</b> In place of wheat bread and other foods, as they said: בִּלְתִּי אֶל הַמָּן עֵינֵינוּ (Numbers 11:6)." "<b>Until they came to the inhabited land.</b> To the land of Sihon and Og, for there they also ate from the bread of the land." "<b>The manna they ate until they came to the edge of the land of Canaan.</b> And together with the bread of the land they ate manna after they entered the land of Sihon and Og, until they crossed the Jordan, as it says: וַיֹּאכְלוּ מֵעֲבוּר הָאָרֶץ מִמָּחֳרַת הַפֶּסַח וַיִּשְׁבֹּת הַמָּן מִמָּחֳרָת (Joshua 5:11–12)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:54.619803642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}